'''Vellmar Airport''' ({{lang|ca|Aeroport de Vellmar}}; [[IATA airport code|IATA]]: VEL, [[ICAO airport code|ICAO]]: VEIB) is a domestic airport serving [[Vellmar]], the secondary commercial centre of [[Nurra Province]], [[Balboa]]. With a metropolitan population of approximately 410,000, Vellmar is one of the larger cities in the Nurra region, and the airport handles a significant volume of domestic traffic. The airport is jet-capable and is served by [[Aeroístmus]] from both hubs.

